      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to build something new. that's the thing. why would i want to spend the rest of my life building a replica of a person who doesn't exist anymore? it feels so fake. like i'm just performing a life for no one. if the version of me that mattered is gone, then what is the point of this biological leftover? it's just... unnecessary. it's like keeping a file on a computer when the program it belongs to has been permanently uninstalled. it's just taking up space.",
